# Shared prefixes for the Turtle and TriG files in this directory. N-Triples
# files have no prefixes, so people.nt spells every IRI in full.
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix dct: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix dx: <https://data.example.net/def/> .
@prefix g: <https://data.example.net/graph/> .
@prefix p: <https://data.example.net/person/> .
